Package: totaljs-docker-source
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Total.js <repository@totaljs.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: ca-certificates
Homepage: https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/ubuntu/
Description: The repository of Docker, for the Total.js Developer Distros
 The signing key and the source of apt of the repository of Docker (download.docker.com),
 where Docker Engine and its Compose plugin come from. The key is the official one of Docker
 (fingerprint 9DC8 5822 9FC7 DD38 854A E2D8 8D81 803C 0EBF CD88). The source is written for
 the series of the system, like the one of the repository of Total.js.
